# Recovered photo archive — cold storage, 1.2GB. Only renditions reach the app.
# LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING: an unanchored `photos/` also matches src/lib/server/photos,
# src/routes/(app)/photos and src/routes/api/photos, and silently drops them from every commit.
